			"notes": "## What's New?\n* Fast, Configurable, Perfectly Optimized Autocrafting system! (**insanely** more optimized than AE2's standard autocrafting system!)\n* -> (Quantum CPU, 100 billion glowstones, 2,415,919,104 crafting co-processors, 17 seconds to complete)\n![spark-internal-mac-craft](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acd0a047-4006-4282-8e6c-9e87d9484db1)\n* -> (Improved Molecular Assembler, 5 stacks cards, 100k glowstones, 2,147,483,646 crafting co-processors, 31 seconds to complete)\n![spark-standart-ae-mac-craft](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c002282c-e299-45a2-a703-3d13abc12c7f)\n* -> (Quantum Interface, 1 million Lead Battery from Industrial Upgrade mod, 2,415,919,104 crafting co-processors)\n![Screenshot 2025-06-09 020853](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0de3f184-34a9-425a-90b3-7ef43e6b66a2)\n* -> (Standart AE2 Interface, 1 million Lead Battery from Industrial Upgrade mod, 2,147,483,646 crafting co-processors)\n![Screenshot 2025-06-09 020611](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0821946c-134e-4658-bdd9-c5e712691bfd)\n\n* Client-side colorful tooltip icons!\n![Screenshot 2025-06-09 011136](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14c12af9-3d2e-4226-89e7-41462081cef9)\n![Screenshot 2025-06-09 011216](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31a403bf-3566-400f-a9a2-541eaccf5e17)\n* Quantum CPU, Quantum Interface that work with the new autocrafting system!\n* Quantum Energy Cell!\n* 262144x, 1048576x, 4194304x, Creative Crafting Co-Processors!\n* 8GB, 32GB, 128GB, Creative Crafting Storages!\n* Item, Fluid, Mana, Energy Trashcans!\n* New models for ME Crafting Units Combiner and ME Improved Crystal Charger!\n* Update Chinese localization by @ZHAY10086 in https://github.com/beecupbe/crazyae/pull/36\n## What's Fixed?\n* Botania Mechanical Machines models\n* Secret dependency on Botaniverse #38 \n* Crash from Redstone Card #37 \n* Crash in new AE2 Unofficial Extended Life versions #34 \n* Copying settings from interfaces\n* something else...?\n\n## New Contributors\n* @ZHAY10086 made their first contribution in https://github.com/beecupbe/crazyae/pull/36\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/beecupbe/crazyae/compare/v0.5.0.3...v0.6"
